# core/data/talk/grammar/en/rom_flirt.tlk - more replies to a flirt (owner: TK; T5b package
# T5B-ROM). Same rules as core_romance.tlk: ADULTS ONLY. Every rule here carries
# adults_only&!kid_present&!pet (lint TK3), a yes carries `consent`, a no carries `!consent`
# (K-5: the target's answer, decided by T6 and the sim; Talk never sets romance state). A no
# is kind and the joke is on the one who asked, never on the one who said no. No sexual-class
# word, no register word, implication only, every line ends on a joke (SCRIPT_STYLE R2),
# at most one exclamation mark a line outside the loud voice, no topic echo. Jealousy lines
# tease a rival or the room, never the third party's harm. No teen voice, no kid voice:
# minors get the safety banks. Syntax: core/tools/talkc_gen.py.

# ---- FLIRT: yes (flirt back) -----------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.flirt.r_yes guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent act: flirt
  "[LOVE]Oh, you're good. I'm going to need a minute and a fan."
  "Careful. I bruise easily, and I wink back."
  "You've got a nice way of saying things. Say them closer."
  "[LOVE]My night just got a new plot. Keep going."
  "If you keep that up I'll forget my own name. It's Steve. Probably."
  "Mm. And you were the quiet one at the start of this."
  "Say that again. I wasn't recording, but I'd like to start."
  "You know, I came here for a snack. I'm staying for you. And the snack."
  "[LOVE]Well, hello trouble. I've been saving a seat."
  "Is that a line? It's working. Please don't tell the line."
  "I'd blush, but my face is out on a smoke break."
  "[LOVE]You're making this very hard to be cool about."
  "Ooh. Do it again with the eyebrow."
  "That was smooth. Did you practise on a mirror, or a very patient lamp?"
  "[LOVE]Honestly? I was hoping you would."
  "Keep talking. I've got nowhere to be and a lot of bad ideas."
  "You're a lot, and I'd like a lot of it."
  "Stop. No wait, don't. My knees voted and it was close."
  "[LOVE]Sweet-talk me any time. I'll even pretend to be surprised."
  "My heart is doing the thing. The thing with the drums."
  "You look like a good decision I'm about to make badly."
  "Charming. Dangerous. I've got a first aid kit, so go on."
  "Right, that tickled. I want a full refund and also more."
  "Careful, I'm easily convinced. Ask my last three hats."
  "[LOVE]Well, my evening needed that, and so did my posture."
  "Okay, you win. I'm blushing in a colour I didn't know I had."
  "I'll wink back if you promise not to look at my elbows."
  "You've got me smiling at a wall. Thanks. The wall's jealous."
  "[LOVE]Is this where I say something clever? I've got nothing. Hi."
  "Slow down. I'm still on your first line. It was a good one."
@rule core.flirt.r_yes_polite guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&polite act: flirt
  "How very forward. I find I don't mind in the least."
  "You're too kind. Do carry on, and mind my heart on the way."
  "Well, I'm quite charmed. My mother would be scandalised."
  "[LOVE]Gracious. I shall need to sit, and perhaps a fan."
  "If this is courting, I accept the invitation. With thanks."
  "That was beautifully said. I'd applaud, but I'm holding a teacup."
  "What a lovely thing to say. I'll treasure it with the napkins."
@rule core.flirt.r_yes_flat guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&flat act: flirt
  "Hm. That worked, and I'm smiling on the inside. It's a lot in there."
  "Okay, yes, do that again. I'm saying it in my excited voice."
  "Noted. Interested. Internally it's a parade."
  "[LOVE]That's nice. I'd say more, but my face is busy."
  "Cool, great. My ears are hot, but don't read into the ears."
  "Fine. You win. Look away while I grin."
@rule core.flirt.r_yes_loud guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&loud act: flirt
  "WOW! Say that where the whole park can hear."
  "[LOVE]Ha ha! You're a menace! Come here, menace."
  "You're making my face loud and I didn't know it could!"
  "Hoo! Somebody call the fire brigade. It's me, I'm the fire."
  "Keep going! I'll cheer after every line!"
  "Phew! My heart's doing laps. Cheer it on."
@rule core.flirt.r_yes_slow guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&slow act: flirt
  "[LOVE]Mmm. Say that again, slowly. I want to enjoy it twice."
  "Well. {.}That's lovely. I'll answer you in a minute, or never."
  "Oh, you. {.}I need a moment to be flattered properly."
  "Take your time. I certainly will. With everything."
  "That landed. Slowly. Like a very happy feather."
  "Hmm. I like that. I'm still on the part before it, but I like it."
@rule core.flirt.r_yes_quick guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&quick act: flirt
  "Ooh, nice, sweet talk, yes, I'm in, where are we going?"
  "[LOVE]Smooth! I'll blush later, I've got a schedule."
  "Hi, yes, charmed, give me a second, I'm doing a little dance."
  "Quick, say another before I think about it."
  "You had me at the first word. The rest was bonus."
@rule core.flirt.r_yes_elder guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&elder act: flirt
  "Well now. At my age that's better than a good knee."
  "[LOVE]Oh, you cheeky thing. I still know a trick or two."
  "I haven't blushed since the last century. Thank you."
  "Don't you stop. My bones haven't had this much attention in years."
  "Flattery will get you everywhere. Slowly, I've got a cane."
  "Hush. You'll make an old soul giddy. Go on, then."
@rule core.flirt.r_yes_blunt guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&blunt act: flirt
  "Good. I like a person who says things. Keep saying them."
  "[LOVE]Straight to it. Fine. I like you too, idiot."
  "Not bad. Not bad at all. Do it again."
  "You're direct. That's rare. Don't ruin it by being modest."
  "Yes, I'm winking back. Obviously. Keep up."
@rule core.flirt.r_yes_quirky guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&quirky act: flirt
  "You woo like a good soup. A little at a time, then everywhere."
  "[LOVE]My heart just did a cartwheel and landed on a snack."
  "Roses are red, I forgot the rest. I'm distracted. It's you."
  "I'd compare you to a summer's day, but those get hot and buggy. You're better."
  "You've turned my brain into a very pleased pudding."
@rule core.flirt.r_yes_easygoing guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&easygoing act: flirt
  "Hey, that's nice. Pull up a seat. We've got all night."
  "[LOVE]Sure, why not. I like where this is going."
  "No rush. We can sweet-talk at our own pace. Ideally with snacks."
  "Mmm, I'm in. The weather's fine and so are you."
  "That's a good start. Let's see where the road goes."
@rule core.flirt.r_yes_serious guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&serious act: flirt
  "I'll be honest. I didn't expect that, and I'm pleased."
  "[LOVE]That was very nicely said. I'll consider it carefully, and favourably."
  "You have my attention. The whole of it, including the part that's embarrassed."
  "Noted with interest. I may even smile. Brace yourself."
  "I rarely say this, but yes. Please continue."
@rule core.flirt.r_yes_hellborn guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&hellborn&!kid_speaker act: flirt
  "[LOVE]Is it hot in here? Never mind, it's always hot. It's you."
  "Down here we call that a spark. Up here, apparently, it's charm."
  "You've got a devilish way with words. I mean it kindly. Mostly."
  "Careful. I may set something on fire, probably your heart. Metaphorically."
  "Keep that up and I'll pencil you into my fiery schedule."
@rule core.flirt.r_yes_ghost guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&ghost act: flirt
  "You make my whole spirit tingle. That's the nicest haunting I've had."
  "[LOVE]I'd go weak at the knees, but I don't have any. Still, wow."
  "Sweet-talking the dead. Bold. I'm into it."
  "My cold heart's going warm. Don't tell the other ghosts."
  "I'd blush, but I'm translucent. Imagine the glow."
@rule core.flirt.r_yes_night guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&night act: flirt
  "Nice line for this hour. The moon is blushing, too."
  "[LOVE]Sweet talk after dark. That's practically a tradition."
  "It's late, and you're being charming. This is dangerous. Go on."
  "The stars are listening, so make it a good one."
@rule core.flirt.r_yes_friend guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&rel=friend act: flirt
  "Oh, so this is where we are now? Fine. I'm in."
  "[LOVE]Friends who woo. Dangerous category. I'll take it."
  "You've been my friend for a while. I'm glad you tried that."
  "Hm. You woo as well as you share snacks. High praise."
  "Is it weird that I like this? Don't answer. Do it again."
@rule core.flirt.r_yes_best guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&rel=best act: flirt
  "You know me too well to charm this well. Keep going."
  "[LOVE]After everything we've seen, we're doing this now? Perfect."
  "Best friends woo like old shoes fit. Comfy, and a bit worn out."
  "I knew you'd try it eventually. I've been rehearsing my blush."
@rule core.flirt.r_yes_partner guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&rel=partner act: flirt
  "[LOVE]Still got it, I see. I'm still falling for it."
  "Wooing your own sweetheart. Efficient. I approve."
  "Every time. Every single time, and my knees still wobble."
  "[LOVE]You're not allowed to be this good at it after all this time."
  "Careful, you'll start something. A dinner. I'll cook."
  "Say it again. I'm collecting them in a very full jar."
@rule core.flirt.r_yes_happy guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&mood=happy act: flirt
  "[LOVE]Your timing's perfect. I'm already in a great mood. Now it's two."
  "Ha, I'm having a lovely day, and you just made it a lovely one with sprinkles."
  "That's wonderful. I'm grinning like a lucky fool."
  "My day was good. Now it's better. Math says that's wooing."
@rule core.flirt.r_yes_tired guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&mood=tired act: flirt
  "I'm exhausted, and that perked me right up. Thank you."
  "[LOVE]Tired, but not too tired. Say more, slowly, yawning optional."
  "Even half asleep I noticed that. Mark it down."
  "You've done the impossible. You woke me up. Don't let it go to your head."

# ---- FLIRT: laugh, joke, tease ---------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.flirt.r_laugh guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent act: laugh
  "Ha! Okay, that one works on me. I hate that it works."
  "Ha ha. You're ridiculous. Come here."
  "Stop it. My face hurts from being charmed."
  "Oh, that's good. That's very good. I'll steal it."
  "[LOVE]Ha! You're funny and nice to look at. Annoying."
  "You're lucky I'm laughing. I could have laughed at someone else."
  "That's the corniest thing I've heard, and I'm turning pink."
  "Ha! Do you have more? Please say yes, I'm weak."
  "You made me snort. That's the highest honour I give."
  "Oh dear. I'm giggling like a teapot. Look what you did."
@rule core.flirt.r_laugh_polite guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&polite act: laugh
  "Oh my. That was rather wicked. And delightful."
  "Forgive the laughter. It was charming, not rude."
  "You're quite impossible. I'm quite enjoying it."
@rule core.flirt.r_laugh_loud guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&loud act: laugh
  "HA! That's the best one this week! Tell the whole bar!"
  "Hoo ha! You're a riot, and you've got great hair!"
  "I laughed so hard a duck left! Worth it!"
@rule core.flirt.r_laugh_flat guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&flat act: laugh
  "Ha. That was my laugh, and you earned it. Don't spend it all."
  "Huh. I'm laughing. Check my face, it's doing something."
  "Funny. I'd say more, but I'm still laughing on the inside."
@rule core.flirt.r_joke guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent act: joke
  "Was that a pickup line, or a medical symptom? Either way, I'm in."
  "My heart skipped a beat. It's fine. I've got a spare."
  "You're about eighty percent charm and twenty percent trouble. Perfect."
  "I'd woo back, but I'm not sure my lines are insured."
  "If charm were illegal you'd be doing time. I'd bring cake."
  "Are you always like this, or do I just win the lottery?"
  "I was going to play it cool. That's gone. It left with the snacks."
  "Wooing me. In public. In front of the furniture."
  "You must be a gardener. You're making me bloom, and it's embarrassing."
  "My therapist says to stay away from charming people. I'm not listening."
  "You're dangerous. I like dangerous. As long as there's a first aid kit."
  "I'd say get a room, but we'd just fill it with snacks."
@rule core.flirt.r_joke_blunt guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&blunt act: joke
  "Sure, charm away. I'm not stopping you. I'm watching, though."
  "That was either a line or a sneeze. I'm going with a line."
  "Fine, you're cute. Don't make it weird. Make it a bit weird."
@rule core.flirt.r_joke_quirky guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&quirky act: joke
  "You've got a face I'd put on a stamp. A very expensive stamp."
  "Is this what butterflies feel like? They're loud. I'll apologise to them."
  "My brain has gone to find a better brain. Leave a message."
@rule core.flirt.r_tease guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent act: tease
  "Is that your best line? It's a good one. I'd like to hear the best best one."
  "Oh, you think you're smooth. You are. Annoyingly."
  "Look at you, wooing like it's a hobby. Do you have a licence?"
  "You've been practising that in the mirror. I can tell. It's working."
  "Hm, a bit forward. Do I like it? Yes, but don't let it show."
  "That's a lot of confidence for someone with that haircut. I like it."
  "Slow down, tiger. Actually, don't. Do a lap first."
  "You woo like you're sneaking snacks. Boldly, with crumbs everywhere."
  "I see what you're doing. Keep doing it. I'm taking notes."
  "Is this a thing we do now? I'd like it noted that I'm enjoying it."
  "So we're pretending we're not wooing. Great. I love pretending."
  "I noticed you looking. I've been looking back, quietly, like a spy."
@rule core.flirt.r_tease_rival guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&rel=rival act: tease
  "Wooing your rival. Bold. I'll beat you at it, too."
  "You're trying to distract me. It's working. I hate that."
  "Careful. If you win me over I'll never forgive you."
  "Look at us, enemies with a spark. A very small, annoyed spark."
@rule core.flirt.r_tease_jealous guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&consent&rel=friend act: tease
  "Do you charm the whole park? Asking for a friend. The friend is me."
  "Is this just for me? Good, be a little selfish. I like it."
  "If anyone else gets one of those, I'll sulk. Dramatically. By the fountain."
  "You're popular. I'm a little jealous, but I'll get over it with cake."

# ---- FLIRT: no (a kind deflection) ---------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.flirt.r_no guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent act: deflect_romance
  "Ha, no. But I'm flattered, and I won't tell."
  "That's sweet. I'm going to pretend I heard a bird."
  "Oh, thanks, but no. Keep that charm for someone who's shopping."
  "I'll pass, kindly. You've got style, though. Point it elsewhere."
  "Not me, friend. You'll find someone. I'd check the bakery."
  "I'm going to say no and then buy you a drink. Not that kind. A tea."
  "Flattering, and a no. Please don't be a stranger, be a nicer one."
  "Ha! No, but your timing was bold. Applause."
  "That's very kind. I'm sorry, no. Can I interest you in a biscuit?"
  "Not for me, thanks. But I'd tell a mirror you're charming."
  "Mm, no. But don't stop being brave. The world needs a few."
  "No, thank you. I'm saving myself for sleep and a good pie."
  "I'm going to say no, and then go and stand over there. Quietly."
  "Sorry, not feeling it. It's me, not you. It's also you, a bit."
  "No, but thanks. I'll put it in the 'nice to be asked' drawer."
  "Ooh, no. But you've got a nice voice. Use it for good."
  "Oh dear. No. I'd say let's stay friends, but I'm not sure we are yet."
  "A very polite no from me, with a tiny bow."
  "Nope. Not today. Ask me again when I've had more sleep and fewer standards."
  "That's a no. A friendly one. With a little wave to go with it."
@rule core.flirt.r_no_polite guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&polite act: deflect_romance
  "How very kind of you. I'm afraid I must decline, with thanks."
  "I'm honoured. And I'm saying no. Gently, with a napkin."
  "You're too generous. I'll have to say no, and mean it kindly."
  "Thank you, truly, but no. Do try the cake. It's lovely."
  "I beg your pardon, but no. I hope we can still say hello."
@rule core.flirt.r_no_blunt guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&blunt act: deflect_romance
  "No, not interested, but the effort's noted. Keep it up for someone else."
  "That's a no. A clear one. I'm pointing at it."
  "No. Don't make it weird. I won't, if you don't."
  "Nope. Try the guy over there. I hear he likes mustard."
  "I'm going to be honest. Nope. But that took guts."
@rule core.flirt.r_no_flat guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&flat act: deflect_romance
  "No, thanks, though. I'm saying it gently. This is gentle."
  "Hm. Not for me. Good luck out there."
  "I'll pass. It's not personal. I don't have a personal."
@rule core.flirt.r_no_elder guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&elder act: deflect_romance
  "Oh, you're sweet. But I've retired from that. I've got a cat."
  "Flattery at my age is a nice surprise. The answer's no, dear."
  "Not for me, love. But go on, I'll enjoy watching somebody else's."
@rule core.flirt.r_no_quick guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&quick act: deflect_romance
  "Aw, thanks, no, sorry, bye, I'm saying it nicely, bye."
  "No, thanks, flattered, got to dash, you're lovely, bye."
  "Nope, sorry, nice try, keep going, somewhere else."
@rule core.flirt.r_no_loud guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&loud act: deflect_romance
  "HA! Nope, but you've got guts! Give them a round of applause."
  "No thanks! Go find someone who likes it LOUD!"
@rule core.flirt.r_no_slow guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&slow act: deflect_romance
  "Oh. {.}That's sweet, and no. {.}But thank you, really."
  "Hmm. {.}I don't think so, {.}sorry. You're nice."
@rule core.flirt.r_no_partner guard: adults_only&!kid_present&!pet&!consent&rel=partner act: deflect_romance
  "Not tonight, love. I've had a day. Let's save the charm for the weekend."
  "Aw. Not just now. I've got a headache and an opinion about socks."
  "I love you, but I'm too tired to be wooed. Ask again later."
